 router←NewHookRouter
 ⍝ A router with OnRequestFn and OnResponseFn set, and #.Mocks.Log and #.Mocks.Seen cleared
 router←#.Mocks.NewAuthRouter
 router.OnRequestFn←'MarkRequest'
 router.OnResponseFn←'LogResponse'
 '/items' router.Get 'ListItems'
 '/items/{id}' router.Get 'GetItem'
 '/broken' router.Get 'BrokenHandler'
 '/me' router.Get ('WhoAmI' (security:,(bearerAuth:⍬)))
 #.Mocks.Log←⍬
 #.Mocks.⎕EX'Seen'
